WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.390
A sunny road along the coast.

2
00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.100
A hill ahead, the sea behind.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.940
A young woman walks with
others, talking and laughing.

4
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:14.200
Then the camera finds it: "A
single sweet bluebell" on the bank.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.360
And everything blurs, as if through tears.

6
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.350
A moment ago, she was laughing.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.060
So why does one small flower make her cry?

8
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:26.360
In this mission, you'll meet
a poet who wrote it at twenty,

9
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.890
working far from home as a governess.

10
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.550
You'll start from her belief
that every flower has a spirit:

11
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.440
"A fine and subtle spirit dwells".

12
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:40.130
And you'll untangle a poem that moves
between different times in her life.

13
00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: explain why one
small flower makes her cry.
